Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How to do this? The world\Nis becoming the paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be on my hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be so strong I can't speak to it.\NI can't speak to it. But I'll play,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon wanted to change Ken's\Nevil ways So he gave his power to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnamon And he finally took\NChimeramon down It wiped Wormmon out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it made Ken realize that the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world wasn't some video game\Nfor his amusement. Just then,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crest of Kindness\Nfloated into Ken's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't enough to save Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of feel bad for Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only went to the\Ndigital world in the first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place because he couldn't\Ndeal with the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where his brother was gone forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx135\fscy135\pos(315,321)}Brave Evolution! XV-mon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, the kingdom was\Nsaved, but there was no joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the land that day for\Nthe king had died in his
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effort to save his people\Nhe mistakenly stood on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the wrong side of the cannon\Nas it was being fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people watched in shock\Nas the king flew overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Cody, you couldn't be a\Nlittle more depressing, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take this tube of\NHydra-something stuff and add
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it to the speaker of a few\Nthings I threw together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let it simmer for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the experiment is almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of doing\Nsome tutoring in chemistry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after school if any of\Nyou boys are interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it supposed to smoke that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just It's the\Nchloro-dicarbonate polyethylene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari is such a graceful\Ndancer. She should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I taught her everything she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach me! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot my dancing shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are lame, watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but net.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only am I the best\Nsoccer player in school,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm the best basketball player, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything in the real\Nworld that Davis isn't the best at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, be modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The basketball game's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stop me, Davis, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two balls for a picture, shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two points, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess anybody can get\Nlucky against Davis once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, we need to learn\Nto pass the ball now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey davis do you need a hand\Nno i need a team that knows how
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to pass the ball i think they're\NYou're starting to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope things are\Nbetter in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already had one nasty trip today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Port, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm surprised that now\Nwith the Digimon Emperor gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still able to come\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we can still come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about the rest of you,\Nbut with the Digimon Emperor gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I plan on having a little\Nfun in the Digi-Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we deserve it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you agree with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of time for\Nrest and relaxation later, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's not why we came\Nto the digital world today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to restore\Nthe digital world to the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way it was before the\NDigimon Emperor took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of areas that\Nare in pretty bad shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're part of the reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:06:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Yoli, give us a damage\Nreport on all the different areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me pull it up on the D-terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountain area is pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to work, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave any stone unturned,\Neven if it's your cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess then we'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gotsumon rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Patamon and TK will\Nhandle the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next is the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that looks in pretty bad shape, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form a single line,\Neverybody, and no cutting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's entree will be tuna surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we didn't have any tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, you get a free lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, he beat me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the farmlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you back him\Non a little to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now a smidge to the right.\NThat's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, we'll take\Nthat one. Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted that area. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only fair thing to do\Nis rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I was\Nchampion in the fourth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next area is the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon and I will take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only area left is the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are headed to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woodmon, you pull and Gizamon, you push.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it right this time. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for a free lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vegiemon, lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta put some backbone into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. You don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, is a dog chasing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK has a theory that I think\Nwe should all listen to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about what Cody said about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still being able to come\Nto the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we figured out that we can come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here because we're still\Nneeded for something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason we were able\Nto come here the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there must be a reason this time too\NThe reason's as plain as the whiskers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on my face We're here to clean up\Nthe mess left by the Digimon Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only problem with that\Ntheory is we volunteered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the work It's not like\Nwe were drafted Exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the part that's been bothering\Nme We're not meant to be here as a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cleanup crew There's something else out\Nthere that we don't know about yet TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you mean a new enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure what it\Nis yet but I think we should
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be prepared for whatever's\Nout there waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were all here just a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you're hiding, we give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alley, alley, oxen free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, V-mon, have you noticed how\NChummy, TK, and Kari are together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're identical twins\Nthat look completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you see how Kari was openly rooting\Nfor TK when we played basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny, I don't quite\Nremember it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just too busy watching Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not that popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want Kari and Gatomon to\Nlike us, we've got to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be better at\Nthe things they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to learn to become\Na better basketball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corry loves me! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have to learn to be a better dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just digivolving to a champion Digimon\Nwho happens to be a great dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A regular Twinkle Toes. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can just pitch her in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon would have nothing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes! V-mon, Digivolve\Nto Champion Mega Dancermon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Ditchie Ma needs a new tailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have a hard time\Nfighting eyeglasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there trying\Nto digivolve into a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might digivolve too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we stop now, Davis? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting really hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you ripped your costume\Nand it was really good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, V-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:12:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you would've just digivolved into a\Nchampion, I never would've had to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried to scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you usually digivolve\Nwhen you're scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, V-mon, you're\Nslower than the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,male!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope your champion form\Nruns faster than you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for part two of\NOperation Make Vimon Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make Vimon back, and then as I'm\Ncrossing this bridge, it breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in order to save me from the fall, Vimon\Nhas to digivolve to the champion level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vimon, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,David, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,David!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, V-Mon, you've got to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon, digivolve, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this another trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Davis, why did you want me to\Ndigivolve into a champion? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that maybe Kari\Nwould like me more if my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon could reach the\NChampion level like Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon wouldn't like me\Nmore if you could digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it couldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't like you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wish you wouldn't rub it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't another one of your tricks to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get me to digivolve\Ninto the champion level,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time it's for real! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing he was here to block it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were great, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't take compliments well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Tortamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a turtle-type Digimon,\Nbut I hide my head from no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use my strong carapace attack\Nto be hard on my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this guy looks pretty angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be pretty angry, too, if I had\Na boulder come at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't throw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll just explain it to\Nhim and everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you seem like a reasonable fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do I know that's not some\NDigimon in disguise trying to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis is trying to trick V-Mon so\Nhe'll Digivolve to the champion level?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he always have some harebrained\Nscheme he's trying to pull off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys look like you've seen a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think that this\NDigimon is mad at you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he thinks he\Nthrew a boulder at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys just\Nexplain the situation to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start with Davis' lame plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finish by saying you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if V-Mom would have digivolved\Nto the champion level in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again with the digivolving thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever noticed that Davis\Nalways gets himself into these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we help them? Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do we know that they'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, somehow, Davis\Nalways lands on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't think Tortamon is\Nreally that angry with them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, one, and two, and three, and four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, what's the big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need help. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered I've got to study\Nfor a big math test next Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, Davy sure has some strange\Nideas about how to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Miyako, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody sent me an email and said you had a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,small problem I would
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not call that small, Yuli?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quick, do something, please Help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurry While you guys are running around\Nplaying games, some of us are working
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please tell me this is\Njust another trick Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think I'm smart enough to\Nthink up something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got bad breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Tyrannomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me just say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one final request. What are\Nyou doing, Daisuke? Shut up and get
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down here oh boy i've always considered\Nmyself a very clean person oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really it's a good thing he's never\Nseen your room before you destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us could you do me a big favor what\Nwould you mind washing your hands huh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't want to get any bad\Ngerms or anything i wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worried about germs right now\NIf you've got a better idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to hear it right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,James is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Germs can be very dangerous,\Nespecially when...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's buying\Nthe whole germ theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Bahn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, do I have a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach this guy a lesson, B-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon, Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-V-V-G-Mon! Digital Monsters!\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, V-Mon, you\Nreached the champion level.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a new Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, why don't you\Nsee my V-Laser attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll make my V-Headbutt look\Nlike a tap on the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EXP HUNCH!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong Carapace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EXP KITCHEN!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tortamon has got to learn\Nto come out of his shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know the\Nbig lug washed his hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after all that's a good habit to get into
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this is what it feels like to be a\Nchampion kind of like a great boxer huh
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only with all your team everybody i'd\Nlike you to meet x v-mon champion digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.98,0:20:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,extraordinaire i've always been fond of\Nv-mon and i'm sure i'll like you as well now
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our cleanup of the digital world will go a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lot faster let's put\Nthem to work all right
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at, X-D-Month?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you're a champion now\Ndoesn't mean you know how to dance yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the way. I'm not\Nlooking at the silhouette.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just looking at the feeling. I can't\Nfind the feeling. I'm going to understand.
